            <note corresp="#d401-f2" n="2" xml:id="d401-f2-content">
                <p>For documentation on the Anglo-Egyptian talks, held at Cairo, Apr. 27–May 6,
                    1953, concerning Suez, see <ref target="frus1952-54v09p2#pg_2051">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ix</hi>, Part 2, pp. 2051</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d401-f3" n="3" xml:id="d401-f3-content">
                <p>Regarding President Eisenhower’s
                    speech on Apr. 16, see the editorial note, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d401-f4" n="4" xml:id="d401-f4-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d401-f5" n="5" xml:id="d401-f5-content">
                <p>Regarding Churchill’s
                    conversations with Eisenhower at
                    New York during the first week of January 1953, see <ref target="#d373">Document
                        373</ref>.</p>
            </note>
